                                "sense_id": "37b27adf-c089-3a87-aeed-23c6f5589995",
                                "text": "These transient fits of oscitation, and inactivity, are perhaps no more than a necessary relaxation to the mind, and serve to quicken its faculties to a more lively sensation of returning pleasure."
